/begin CHARACTERISTIC KL_LAM_SOLL_VL
  "SOLL-Lambda - Vollast | EN: Target lambda - full load | [Code V452 INJ 0x4596C] Full-load lambda over n. On entering full load the current target is frozen as lam_w.soll_vl_bezug; then target = bezug + f x (KL_LAM_SOLL_VL - bezug) + knock offset, f = (md_wunsch_rel - zust_md_rel_tl_vl)/(100 % - threshold): 0 at 90 % torque demand, 1.0 at 100 %. Full value only at 100 % demand. Cat protection can make it richer, never leaner."
