/begin CHARACTERISTIC KF_LAM_SOLL_GRUND
  "SOLL-Lambda - Normalbetrieb | EN: Target lambda - normal operation | [Code V452 INJ 0x4596C] Part-load lambda target (n x rf_m), per bank via state machine lam_w.soll_zust_st: start KL_LAM_SOLL_START | normal KF_LAM_SOLL_GRUND + wall-film offset + knock offset (K_LAM_SOLL_KR_KATS) | warm-up KF_LAM_SOLL_WL x KF_LAM_SOLL_WL_F | full load: blend to KL_LAM_SOLL_VL | safety/misfire KF_LAM_SOLL_AUSS_KATS. Then min(target, cat-protection lambda) -> + K_LAM_SOLL_OFFS_MCS -> change limit -> K_LAM_SOLL_MIN..MAX -> lam_soll_b."
